            rdfs:comment "Defines when an AI system is classified as high-risk, triggering stricter requirements where systems may significantly affect health, safety or fundamental rights, including non-discrimination. Notes: Determines when the comprehensive high-risk regime, including fairness safeguards, applies." .


###  https://purl.org/fairops/indiv#Art.6.2
indiv:Art.6.2 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       core:LegalRequirement ,
                       core:ManagementLegalRequirement ;
              ns1:SIO_000068 core:EU_AI_Act ;
              core:isOperationalizedBy indiv:Calibration ,
